{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/808225-requiem-for-rome-new-wave-requiem-how-much-conversion-is-needed","id":808225,"title":"Requiem for rome/ New Wave Requiem, how much conversion is needed?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-13T14:16:14-08:00","id":808225,"title":"Requiem for rome/ New Wave Requiem, how much conversion is needed?","content":"these books only really glanced at them after blood and smoke came out... any idea Ho wmuch updating they'd need? For example how to convert Julii to 2nd edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T14:45:36-08:00","id":808245,"title":"","content":"They don't really need much. The benefits of the different wings of the Camarilla might need an update (The Legio Mortuum is the one that's the least analogous to any other) and you'd probably want to give the Julii a more interesting Clan Bane that reflects a similar schpiel, but I think you can otherwise run it as is.<br /> <br /> The nice thing about some of the fighting styles in the new Hurt Locker book is that the spoilers seem in some of them to reflect some of the stuff in RfR.<br /> <br /> The only system that comes to mind is the Debate system, which might require more consideration. One way you could run that is that it's Social Maneuvering, where the urgency of the debate increases Impression to the point of being hours/minutes/turns in length, with both characters competing to open the Doors of the audience.<br /> <br /> New Wave Requiem can be run right out of the box using the 2e rules. You'll quickly pick up on the edition discrepancies in some of the descriptions, but it just means you can ignore any discussion of people blurring in mirrors and shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T15:48:19-08:00","id":808292,"title":"","content":"Venefica is might need some work, but it should be easy via the Blood Sorcery book to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","ran